### Create test application
POST http://localhost:8080/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Netflix",
  "jobTitle": "Backend Developer",
  "status": "APPLIED"
}

### Search by job title
GET http://localhost:8080/applications/search/job-title?jobTitle=BACK
### Create an application for deletion test
POST http://localhost:8080/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Apple",
  "jobTitle": "Backend Developer",
  "status": "APPLIED"
}
### Delete the application
DELETE http://localhost:8080/applications/1

### Verify deletion
GET http://localhost:8080/applications/1